ype='text'>Another fantastic article Will. I&amp;#39;ve been sayi...</title><content type='html'>Another fantastic article Will. I&amp;#39;ve been saying this for awhile that conservatives who lick the boots of leviathan in this latest episode were cursing his name when those same thugs went after Bundy. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Being a New York state citizen I also question these conservative badge lickers if they&amp;#39;ll follow orders of the enforcement class when Governor Andrew Cuomo starts to really enforce the SAFE Act.(aka turn in your weapons, register them, etc) Especially with those two deaths, who knows what the slime in Albany are possibly cooking up for us who choose to exercise our rights to defend ourselves. Of course no conservative has given me a real answer outside of their standard squawking of their insults and mindless rambling that comes whenever a libertarian makes them look stupid. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If you dont know what the SAFE Act in NY is, here is a decent breakdown of it&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NY_SAFE_Act&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There isnt much to say of the left given like the right, hypocrisy is a long tradition. Like the right the left&amp;#39;s desire for state violence is well documented. They (like the right) have no leg to stand on when it comes to coproach brutality as they support it in other forms.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Let moronic Sharpton lefitsts and the paleocon right squawk that this is the start of some mythical race war that many of these statissts have been dreaming about since the 60s. All these clowns do is provide a distraction. Real liberty lovers such as yourself and others know that it&amp;#39;s not race its government vs the people.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/2868019111908588477'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/2868019111908588477'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html?showComment=1419741687469#c2868019111908588477' title=''/><author><name>NY Cynic</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05131625126863049626</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-iMAJnbGTsJA/Tc3h2RqkqxI/AAAAAAAAAAY/zCQBUEhGPAY/s220/Gold%2Band%2BBlag%2BFlag.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4209695811715217943' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4209695811715217943' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-997150381"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2014 at 9:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1717982286867377135</id><published>2014-12-27T17:24:12.504-07:00</published><updated>2014-12-27T17:24:12.504-07:00</updated><title type='text'>If as they say, &amp;quot;words mean things&amp;quot;, the...</title><content type='html'>If as they say, &amp;quot;words mean things&amp;quot;, then everyone who supported and pontificated long and loud over Iraq and elsewhere are responsible for the deaths of countless thousands.  Eh?  Or am I missing something?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/1717982286867377135'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/1717982286867377135'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html?showComment=1419726252504#c1717982286867377135' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4209695811715217943' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4209695811715217943' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-643015980"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2014 at 5:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5620089212859223075</id><published>2014-12-27T13:46:23.536-07:00</published><updated>2014-12-27T13:46:23.536-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s the same with school shootings. The right...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s the same with school shootings. The right will complain vociferously when the left politicizes a school shooting and demands more gun control. As soon as two cops are shot in New York, they rolled out their political machinery.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/5620089212859223075'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4209695811715217943/comments/default/5620089212859223075'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html?showComment=1419713183536#c5620089212859223075' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/12/law-and-order-leninism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4209695811715217943' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4209695811715217943' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1415627142"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2014 at 1:46 PM"/></entry></feed>